<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Hona Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timoti</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Timoti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Kyagha ɗeleewar ɗaɓa ya a har Mbulus, tǝthlǝnda Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, faɗang nda tǝ sǝsǝmnda Faara tǝ Hǝrǝkrǝnǝm tǝ ƙǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti nǝm shengteena fa. <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />A Timoti ka waana ahu fǝrƙǝkafek. Ngwa furowa Faara na China tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso na Chinǝm nggayirha, a haɗowun fa, tǝ ɗǝɗemnggirha.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yiyi thlǝmaarha aten tsahad nggaɓaarha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Nani a wiirha a Makidoniya ɗǝ, hwanɗi sa a tsawa na a Afisa ˈwan tǝna ƙǝs thlǝmad fingya nafiya a mbǝɗi a malang ngganda tsahan ndan ha yi nggaɓaarha. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Kamɗǝ a ƙǝs thlǝmad ndan na a malang ngganda mbǝtta hai aten sǝk asǝɗaya mbuwana ƙǝkafek, tǝ thlǝtta thlǝmngya chichiiya mbuwana mii ngwaladghǝn sǝ. Ƙǝsǝr tur ǝngginiya nǝn ɓaarha ɓa tǝ ngaala. Mbǝ ɗang niifa sǝ a ǝna tar Faara nǝn tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Fǝrni ngyahadɗiya tǝna fatakkwaya Yeeso narha tǝ nggǝmnda fa ɓagha ɓa ahu hura na chahal tǝ hura tsahai na, tǝ kad fǝrƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Amma fingya famalǝmngya sǝ ˈwanda teena kyalth nda hai ma ten laɓarɗiya kahad, mbǝɗa nda hai tǝ thlǝk laɓar nuryirha. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Na mindan sǝ a tsawanda ƙǝla fa malǝmgya ngyakhrha Musa. Amma sǝngwanda ˈya nanda thlǝkrha wa, a sakwata ǝnɗi na nda njib ndaarha sǝnda ˈya na nda a thlǝkrha. <verse eid="1TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Sǝn ɗǝm sǝ tǝ ndaarha na ngyahadɗi ngga, a ǝna ɗǝm taara sǝ ahu kwamana na mǝmǝl. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Sǝn ɗǝm sǝ kǝm tǝ ndaarha, mbǝ ka nafiya mbuwa ɗimi ǝna nanda ngyakhkya wa, kǝl nafiya mbuwa takkwa ngyakhrha tǝ sǝk ˈya, tǝ nafiya mbuwana ǝn ǝnandan kǝla yi Faara, tǝ nafiya na ɗimi, tǝ nafiya mbuwana hur ndan pǝpet, tǝ nafiya na sar Faara, tǝ nafiya na ɓǝlang chinggindan, ko manggindan, tǝ fa ɓǝl faaya. <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />Ngyakhkini ya ǝna nan ndan ka kulafaya, nduwa hǝshya na mǝnda tǝ hǝshya, nduwa nishya na mǝnda tǝ nishya nduwa fa ngar faaya, nduwa fa nggaɓaya tǝ niifa na pǝr nggaɓaarha ko ndanǝn nǝn a pǝr ƙǝkafek, tǝ kǝm kala ˈya heu mbuwa mǝmǝl tǝ tsaharha ha yi ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Tsahadɗa ha ya nǝghǝn mǝmǝl tǝ Laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn yi Faara na tǝ parka na manggǝn fǝre nanda hu haara hai a pǝrghǝn ni ɗǝ.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usarha ka nggayid Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Niya usa Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso Chinǝm, fǝreegha kanglanggirha. Ƙǝleeɗǝ ka niifani nggi wurnǝn nggi ka a ǝnang taara ni. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Ko nanǝn ƙǝtǝm ni naarha sar Ƙǝrǝsti, tǝ mbǝlfeerha sǝsangga nafiyighǝn. Amma haɗang ɗi fa ƙǝsǝr ˈya ǝna ni heu nǝghǝn hu yamid sǝnda ni tǝ yamid fǝrƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Nggayid Chinǝm lǝɗeeɗǝ kaan tǝ kǝm fǝre ɗǝ fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ nggǝmnda ɓagha ɓa a thlǝmad Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Laɓarɗiya ƙǝkafek ni, tǝ kǝm kowunni a fǝrƙǝkafek nǝn tǝghǝn. Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso ɓanǝn hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa ka a hǝrghanggǝn fa ɗimiya ahur ndan heu nggi kalgha kanda tǝ ɗimiyirha. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Amma keɗee Faara nggayirha, nggi kalgha nafiya ɗimiyirha, Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ƙǝrǝs ɗǝ tǝ nggi kaan ka tsawi ǝnsakrha ka fiya heu ɓagha fǝrƙǝkafek tǝghǝn tǝ kǝm wal yibrha nda mbuwa ngwalarha. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Ngwa tsauka mamnggirha tǝ faala a Faara pakwanɗǝ. Ndǝghǝnni kutǝra yi pakwanɗǝ, mbuwa nǝm naarha, mbuwa mǝra; ndǝghǝnni Faara katenggǝn. A tsaukwa kee. <verse eid="1TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timoti, waana, niya pǝro palthɗiya ƙǝsǝr ka ˈya ˈwa na annabiya pǝra a ten wa ka ƙǝtǝm. Ƙǝsǝr ahu laf ǝngginiya na mbang yanda ngga ƙǝla ka sodja. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Ƙǝsu fǝrƙǝkafekkid wa ha ngga ahu Ƙǝrǝsti. Tsawu tǝ hura tsahai, ƙǝsǝr fingya nafiya tǝ thlǝmǝn kar nda ǝngginiya; ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnɗiya ndǝn ǝnagha ndǝn fǝlna nda hai. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />A hur ndan na Himeniyus sǝ tǝ Aledzanda, fǝrang ni Sheetan ka tsahang huteena nǝn kanda ha ka malang ngganda sar Faara.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwaman tǝrang shilee Faara teena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Niya ndang nda kun, ˈwaama hwanang Faara fiya teena heu. Hwana man Faara a ɗanggǝn kanda sǝ na a haɗanggǝn kanda fa, tǝ ƙǝm usaghǝnun ka kanda. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />Hwana man Faara kutǝrya teena kiya tǝ fingya mamngya, tǝ nǝm tsau ɗǝɗemnggirha kula mbeela, tǝ tǝrǝm Faara tǝ hura chahal. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Tur hwandǝɗi ya nǝghǝn ngga, nǝn mbǝnang Faara tǝ Hǝrǝkrǝnǝm. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />Na mid Faara sǝ kowunni a hǝrǝkka tǝ kǝm a sǝn ƙǝkafekidɗa nǝn heu. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Faara nǝghǝn tǝtal, Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ni katenggǝn na ɓang kǝm thlǝmad Faara ɓa. Yeeso ƙǝkafek niifa ni, fǝrɗǝ fadghǝn ka a hǝrghanggǝn kǝm. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />Fǝrɗǝ yiɓǝdghǝn ka heng wal alteena nǝn ƙǝmsǝ. Kyaɗang Faara ǝnɗi kǝm ya ahu mǝmǝlla sayi. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Ndǝghǝn ɗani ǝnagha ndǝn wurna Faara nggi a tsawi tǝ tǝthlǝnda Yeeso tǝ ƙǝm tǝ pǝr Laɓar Faara na Mbǝnggǝn. Niya pǝr ƙǝkafek, mbi a nggaɓaarha wa. Thlǝngga Faara nggi ɓa a tsahang nggi nafiya ha mbuwa Yahudaya aten fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Nanǝn kee a wum ɗun hai ka ɗǝfang shilee nun Faara in, na mid na sǝ hǝshya tǝrang ngganda haryindan sǝ na chahal a talara sǝ hwan Faara nda, kula sǝbrha hura ko ngaala tǝ ndan. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Akwasamad yanɗiya na mid na sǝ nishya a ngwang ngganda fandan fa tǝ kari kamngga, a sakhɗang nda wasyindan wa, nduwa kal kari nda fa na tǝ wuɗǝɓǝla fa wa nduwa ƙǝn ǝn urarha nda ǝna nanda tǝ tǝfasa fingya ǝngya na chimnda fa. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Amma nishya ndagha nggǝmnda Faara, kamɗǝ a ǝna ǝngya nda na ngga. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Ngwa tsauka nishya fa thlǝ tsaharha ha tǝtip tǝ fǝr mamnggirha. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Fǝranggi kwamana nishya a tsahang ngganda hǝshya ha wa nduwa a tsawa nda aten ndan wa. A kathlǝmaarha nda hai tǝtip. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Ƙǝsǝr Faara ˈwaghǝn ǝna Adamu ambǝra ǝna Hauwawu nǝn. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Mbǝ Adamu ni nggaɓa nanda wa, amma nuɗa ni nggaɓa nanda tsaunǝn tǝ ɗimiyirha. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Amma nishya na nda a wal hǝrǝkrha ahu nggǝtta a ɗǝnda mbeeɗǝ hu fǝrƙǝkafek tǝ nggǝmnda tǝ hura chahal, tǝ ƙǝs alteena.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Mangya Ƙǝn Faara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Nǝghǝn ƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha kala niifa na midghǝn sǝ tsaurha shingnda aten fatakkwaya taara ni na ngga. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Mamnda tsaukwa kula ǝn ˈyaara a mbed fiya, a tsauka tǝ nuneefa tǝtal, kǝsanggǝn altenggǝn, niifa ni huhwar, na a takkwarha tǝ altenggǝn ngga, na thlǝ rongya fa, mbangga tsaharha ha. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />A tsauka niifa ni mbuwa sa aam inabi ni na a tǝranggǝn teena wa, niifa mbuwa yanda, amma tsauka mǝsǝlǝm nda niifa, mbuwa nggǝm kakyathlaanga fa, tǝ kǝm mbǝ niifa ni na yakh nggǝm wuɗǝɓǝla wa. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Tǝtani a tsauka niifa na mbang laf wurighǝn ngga, tǝ wanggighǝn ana nda a fǝrang mamnggirha ahu ˈya na heu. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Ƙǝsǝr niifa mbang ngwa wa laf wurighǝn ngga, ƙǝƙǝn nǝn mbang kǝla nafiya ha na takkwa Faara? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />A tsauɗǝ weerǝnda niifa ni fǝrgha ƙǝkafek wa, ƙǝsǝr nǝn manang nda altenggǝn ka wurna ndan wet, na nda a ngwang kumarha sǝ ƙǝla Sheetan. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Tǝ kǝm, nafiya mbuwa fatakkwaya, thlǝk ˈya ngga a tenggǝn amawanǝn mukrha ahu takthlǝr sheetan hai fǝlgha hai tsauka ǝn shilee.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Nǝghǝn kee kǝm ahu fingya nafiya na a ǝna taara ahur fatakkwaya, tǝtani a tsawanda nafiya ni na nda fǝrang mamnggirha kanda, na tǝ ǝn ǝnandan ngga, mba nda tǝ mee sǝri wa, mbǝ nafiya na sa aam inabi kaan wa nduwa nafiya na ngingilǝm tǝ wuɗǝɓǝla wa. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Tǝtani a ƙǝs fǝrƙǝkafekkid nǝm ha kyaɗang na Faara ƙǝm tǝ hura tsahai. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Tǝtani a ˈwa nda teena ƙǝƙǝrang ngganda kanda a mbǝ ǝnˈyaara sǝ a fad ndan wa, ngwa tsawa nda fa tarya. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Nǝghǝn kee kǝm nishyindan a tsawa nda kula ǝnˈyaara fa, mbǝ fa kikifaya wa, nafiya ƙǝsangga alten ndan, kanda a ǝna ˈya tǝ ƙǝkafek ahu ǝngya heu. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Niifa na a ǝna taara ahur fatakkwaya, a tsaukwa tǝ nukkun tǝtal, na mbang laf wanggighǝn tǝ fingya fa wurayighǝn ngga. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Nafiya na a ǝna taara ngga ahur fatakkwaya na nda wal ƙǝnaghǝn, na nda fǝrang mamnggirha kanda ma fiya, tǝ kǝm na nda wal chikrha kanlanggirha hu fǝrƙǝkafekkid ndan hu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="1TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Niya chireethlǝng ǝnggini kun ɗǝ nanǝnya, ko nanǝn na mid na sǝ ɗǝrha thlǝmad nun ɗǝ a mbee. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Amma a mbǝdɗi hai, na sǝn kwamana na fiya a takkwarha tǝ altendan ahu Ƙǝn Faara. Nafiya ni yi Faara na tǝ yibrha fa, ndǝna hǝhǝrshe tǝ sar ƙǝnna na a ƙǝs ƙǝkafek ha. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Mbǝ ngaala sǝ wa ˈya na ɓǝɓee aten fǝrƙǝkafekkid nǝm nǝghǝn manggǝn: ɓagha Yeeso ɓa ahu thlu farha. Kyad ndan tǝ ƙǝkafek ni hu Sǝsǝna tǝ Peɗǝnda, nad fa thlǝngya Faara ndǝn. Pǝr nda laɓar Yeeso a chehweeya. Fiya na ahu ƙǝshiirha fǝr nda ƙǝkafek tǝghǝn, tǝrang nda talara ɗǝ hu mamnggirha.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Yiyi thlǝmaarha aten tsaharha ha yi nggaɓarha tǝ ka ƙǝna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Sǝsǝn Faara tǝ Pǝɗǝnda thlǝk ɗa ndǝn a pǝpal tǝ ndaarha, a mii ngwala ƙǝshiirha fiya hangga nanda kyaharra ma fǝrƙǝkafekkid ndan. Nanda takkwa sǝsǝngya yi nggaɓarha tǝ tsaharha ha tur yi ǝnkaheeya. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Tur fa tsahayini ya fa thlǝrɓuya ni tǝ fa nggaɓaya. Nanda nggaɓa fandan fatakkwaya ni, amma mbǝ huryi ndan tsahai wa. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />ˈYaɗang nda kakhrha fiya fa tǝ hǝb fingya ǝnnayami. Amma Faara ǝnagha ǝnnayini mii, tǝna fingya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek tǝ ƙǝm sǝngga ƙǝkafekkid laɓarghǝn na nda thlǝ ǝnnadɗami usaghǝnda. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Ƙǝsǝr ˈya ǝnana Faara heu nǝghǝn ngga, mbǝ ˈyasǝ nǝm kaara wa, a thlǝɗǝm ndǝn tǝ usaarha. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Sǝn ɗǝm sǝ nǝghǝn chahal ka ˈya ndana Faara, tǝ ƙǝm hwanda nǝm a ǝnaarha kapa nǝm ǝna ˈya mii.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tǝ taara na ngga yi Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />A tsahangna ǝnggini fatakkwaya ha ya, na tsaurha ka mafad Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. Na kyad ndaarha tsǝnna ahu laɓar fǝrƙǝkafekkid nǝm tǝ tsahadɗa ha ngga takkwana. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />No inggun ma sǝk ǝngya ka ka tǝ asǝɗad nuryirha. Tsǝtsǝlu altenwa tsawa na ƙǝla na mid Faara. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Ko nanǝn tsǝtsǝl thlu farha nǝn ngga, amma tsaurha kǝla na mid Faara kalɗa ndǝn ko ahu yanggi kwamana, ƙǝsǝr nǝn ɓarha ɓa tǝ parka yi yibrha nanǝnya tǝ yi na ɓayi. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Laɓarɗiya ƙǝkafek ni, kowunni a thlǝghǝnǝn fa. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Nǝm a ǝna taara kaan tǝ sǝsarha ka a fǝrgha fiya ƙǝkafek, ƙǝsǝr shiiten nǝm nǝghǝn a thlǝma Faara na tǝ yibrha fa, tǝ hǝrghang nda fiya heu, mbǝ ƙǝla nafiya fǝrgha ƙǝkafek mawa. <verse eid="1TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Tsahang ǝnggini fiya ha ya njib kowunni na a tsahaghǝnǝn. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />A nggǝmna fa a sargha niifa sa ƙǝsǝr ka nana wundakhne wa. Tsawu ǝnsakhrha a nafiya heu fǝrgha ƙǝkafek ahu ˈya na thlǝkrha, tǝ kwamana na wiirha, ahu nggǝm nduwa, fǝrƙǝkafekkid wa, tǝ tsawudwa chahal. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Kapa ni ɓarha ɓa, ɗu mbeeɗǝ tǝ karata ɗeleewar Faara a fiya, tǝ pǝr laɓar Faara tǝ tsaharha ha. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />A malang na ǝnfǝra tǝ peɗǝnda fǝrona Faara wa a sayidɗi kal na annabi sǝ wumna shingya Ƙǝn Faara hai ɗǝfo nanda haara teena. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Tsahu ǝnggini ya tǝ sammayirha. Furu altenwa a kanda, tǝna kowunni na ɗǝdwa mbee ɗǝ. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Kwaru wiid wa hai, tǝ ƙǝm a sǝnasǝ ˈya na tsaharha ha aten Faara nǝghǝn mǝmǝl. Ƙǝtsar ɗu mbee ɗǝ tǝ ǝna ǝngginiya, ƙǝsǝr a ǝnanna kee na hǝrghang alten wa tǝ fiya na sǝk fadwa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Əngya kamngga a ǝnagha fingya fatakkwaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />A yanang na shingnda tǝ njaara wa, hwanuwun tǝ sammayirha kǝla yiwa china. Wundǝlaya kǝm, kalang kanda sǝ kǝla wan manggiwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Fǝrang mamnggirha suhurya nishya kǝla manggiwa, kalang wangya nishya sǝ kǝm kǝla wan manggiwa tǝ hura chahal. <verse eid="1TI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Ɗang nishya mǝrya sǝ na a kaɗa thlaara tǝ ƙǝkafek. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Amma ana nu mǝrra sǝ na tǝ wanggighǝn sǝ nduwa kaghayighǝn, a takkwa samad Faara nda ˈwan, na nda a ǝna taara tǝ ǝnɗi tsahana nda. Na nda a ƙǝlang hurfayindan, na nda a ɗang chinggindan sǝ tǝ kaghayindan ƙǝla ˈwa na nda ǝnang kanda, ƙǝsǝr nǝn mbǝnang nda Faara. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Nu mǝrra na midghǝn thlaara mal nandan katenggǝn nǝn shengteena Faara fa tǝ kǝm nǝn ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ tǝ hwan Faara nda fiɗikrha tǝ yanfaara a ɗanggǝn sǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Amma nu mǝrra na tsaurha ka tǝk mbǝnda fa kee, ˈwaɗǝ teena mǝrɗǝ ko ɓal nǝn a yibrha fa ƙǝsǝr tsakh pathlanggǝn hai tǝ Faara. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Pǝrang ǝnggini fatakkwaya ya amawana kowunni tsaurha ǝnˈyaara ahu ǝngginiya. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Nafiya mbuwa ɗang hurfayindan sǝ, mbǝ kǝla ma nafiya nananda ahur minda tal wa, kaar nda ˈya fǝr nǝm ƙǝkafek atenggǝn. Tur nafini ya kal nda nafiya fǝrwawa ƙǝkafek sǝbrha ɗǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Kapa nǝm thlǝɗang nda nu mǝrra ahur nishya mǝrya hai na fatakkwaya ɗang kanda sǝ, kǝl a kalɗǝ hurarha kumnggit mikki, tǝ kǝm ka nuneefa ni hu sayidɗi ɓal na chimadghǝn hai. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Tǝtani a fǝrangga fiya mamnggirha ƙǝsǝr ka ˈya ǝnanǝn na ngga. Ƙǝrang ɗǝ wanggighǝn sǝ ngga wa? Nǝn thlǝ rongya fa tǝ ǝnnarhami wa? Nǝn ǝnang taara fingya fatakkwaya kula manang nda altenggǝn wa? Nǝn ɗang nda nafiya sǝ na hu ɓillarha wa? Nǝghǝn nggungwa fa ƙǝtsar ka a ǝna ˈya nǝn na ngga wa? <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Nishya mǝrya ɓalgha weerǝn, a thlǝɗang ɗun kanda ahu nishya mǝrya hai wa, ƙǝsǝr ɓanda narha ngingilǝm tǝ hǝshya ndusanggǝn hurndan ɗǝ ma Ƙǝrǝsti, tǝrgha mindan ɗǝrha chimadɗǝ. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />A nggǝr nda kakhrha na Faara a tsǝtsǝl kanda, ƙǝsǝr hwasang nda ɗǝf mii ndan ˈwa nanda ǝnaarha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ƙǝsǝr ɗǝf nda mee ƙǝtǝm mba nda nggǝr ɗǝrha chimadɗǝ wa ndǝn thlǝɗang nanda kanda ahur nishya mǝrya hai ka a ɗangga fatakkwaya kanda sǝ. </char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Mbǝ ma kee wa, na nda tsaha sǝsaukirha, na nda naarha wii hu wuraya. Mbǝ tsawud sǝsaukirha kee wa, amma har tǝ kiki farha fa tǝ kyarha hu ˈya hai mbuwa yindan, nanda thlǝk ǝngya kamngwawa. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Nanǝn kee niya ndang nishya mǝrna chimayindan ɓalgha weerǝn, a nggǝrgha nda ɗǝrha chimadɗǝ, nggǝt wundakhnaya nda, kǝla wurayindan nda ha. Tǝrgha tǝ tsanda mbǝ mbang thlǝk ˈya ɗimi aten ndan wa. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Ƙǝsǝr fingya nishya mǝrya ɓalgha weerǝn ˈwanda teena kyahar nda hai ma Faara, mbusamad Sheetan nda. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />A na nuneefa sǝ tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek na hurfayighǝn sǝ mǝrna chimayindan, tǝtani a ɗanggǝn kanda sǝ, a fǝrang ɗǝ hǝr fatakkwaya wa. Tǝrgha na fatakkwaya ɗang nda nishya mǝryina sǝ mbuwana fa thlarǝndan sǝ.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Shingya na ǝna tar ndan mǝmǝl kamɗǝ a fǝrang mamnggirha nda kanda, tǝ ƙǝm teng ngganda kanda ngga, mbǝ kǝla ma nafiya na ǝna taara kaan yi pǝr laɓar Faara tǝ tsaharha ha wa. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Ƙǝsǝr ndagha ɗeleewar Faara, “Mbǝm nggǝlang mii kwel anaɗǝ a ɗǝk hwarma tǝ wiirha hai atenggǝn wa”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗeleewar Nggǝr Kumaarha 25:4 </char></note>, tǝ kǝm, “Tǝ taara kamɗǝ teng thlǝthlǝn ndǝghǝn nda”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luka 10:7</char></note>. <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />A kangna thlǝmaarha huhwaarha fa aten shingnda wa, kǝl ana nafiya sǝ sǝri nduwa mahan ɓagha ɓa tǝ tur huhwadɗi. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Kala shingnda ǝnagha ˈya na ɗimi ƙǝs thlǝmadghǝnun a mbed fatakkwaya heu tǝna fingya tǝrǝm Faara ngga. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />A mbed Faara tǝ Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso tǝ fathlǝngya Faara na wuwura, niyi a ƙǝs thlǝmad wa a takkwa ǝnggina na ya a wurna hasǝ wa, nduwa kar yanɗa na ya, nggǝm yi ɗa na taarha wa. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />A nanna ƙǝkaryirha hu ɗǝfang nda niifa a tsauka shinggǝn aten tar Chinǝm wa. A ǝnanna ˈya na ɗimi ƙǝsǝr ka ǝnana fingya wa, amma tsawu chahal. <verse eid="1TI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />A sanna aama kee wa, so aam inabi ngguchit ka hatta hurwa tǝ ɓeerha farha na tǝ ǝnorha. <verse eid="1TI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Ɗimiyid fingya nafiya nǝghǝn a pǝpal, tǝ kǝm ɗimiyid ndan ˈwaɗǝ mbeeɗǝ kapa na nda ngwang kumarha kanda sǝ. Amma fingya ɗimiyid ndan nǝn kyarha pǝpal ɓa a samarha. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Nǝghǝn kee kǝm tarya na ngga nanda a pǝpal, ko mba nda a pǝpal ma wa, mba nda narha ɓǝɓee wa.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Fatakkwaya na hu tsawud mafayirha ana nda a fǝrang mamnggirha turayindan amana thlǝm Faara tǝ tsahadghǝn ha tsaurha ǝn shilee. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Fingya mafaya na turayindan fatakkwaya, a fǝrang mamnggirha nda kanda kaan, ƙǝsǝr kanda ni a wan manggi ahu Ƙǝrǝsti. A ǝnang taara nda kanda kaan, ƙǝsǝr thlarrǝɗi kyandan a ɗang turayindan sǝ nggǝmna nda kanda kaan. Tsahang ǝnggini fatakkwaya ha ya, fǝrang kaali kanda a ǝnaghǝnda.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yiyi thlǝmarha aten tsaharhaha yi nggaɓarha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Fingya nafiya na nda tsaha ˈya ha mbuwa ƙǝkafek mǝmǝlwa tǝ tsahad Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti wa. Mba nda tsahang ǝngya fiya ha na ɗang nda fiya sǝ ǝna ˈya nda ƙǝla na mid Faara wa. <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />Tur nafini kargha fa na nda taala tǝ alten ndan, amma mbǝ ˈya sǝ sǝn nanda wa. Na nda numa mbǝlfeerha hu ngaala aten laɓarya. Nanda ɓarha ɓa tǝ sǝrǝkrha, tǝ yanda, tǝ ˈyar farha, tǝ numad mbǝlfeerha aten ndan, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />tǝ pǝpeethla tǝ ndan. Mba nda mbang ɗǝghang ˈya hai na ngga tǝ mbuwa ngga wa. Mba nda mbang sǝn ˈya na ƙǝkafek wa. Na nda numarha takkwa Faara kwaman wal kǝna ni. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Kǝkafek ni! Ana hur niifa huhuna hai tǝ ˈya nanǝn tǝghǝn ha, na kǝna sǝ kaan ahu takkwa Faara. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Ƙǝsǝr ɓawum hu ƙǝshiirha ɓa tǝ ˈya ha wa, tǝ ƙǝm mbǝm a kyarha sǝ tǝ ˈya ha wa. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Amma ana ǝnnarhami sǝ tǝ luwud kaala fa, ǝngginiya ma tsǝghang ɗǝ kǝm kee. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Nafiya na mid ndan kǝna nanda kyarha hu kǝkǝrra hai, tǝ takhthler ǝn nuryirha hangga tǝ nggǝm ǝngya mbuwa ngga, tǝ ˈya na huk kanda sǝɓa nda ɗǝ. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Ƙǝsǝr nggǝm wuɗǝɓǝla ndǝna kul mbǝlfeerha. Fingya nafiya ahu nggǝm kǝna kyahar nda ha ma fǝrƙǝkafek, muwang ngganda fad ndan ahu sǝbrha hura hai kaan.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nggǝlmi yiyi thlǝmaarha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Amma sa, niif Faara, ɗau ma ǝnggini ya, kaɗu nggayirha, ǝn ǝnad wa a nagha kǝla yi Faara, tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek, tǝ nggǝmnda, tǝ ƙǝrǝsta kula huhwafyirha. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Yanu ka yanda yi fǝrƙǝkafek. Thlu kǝnanghǝn yi yibrha mbuwa ngwalarha furo na Faara a sayidɗi pǝrna ndaarha fǝr na ƙǝkafǝk a Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti a mbed fiya hangga sǝkka fadwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Niya hwan sa a mbed Faara na fǝr yibrha a ǝngya heu, tǝ kǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti pǝr nǝn ƙǝkafek a mbed Mbuntus Mbilatus. <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Niya ndorha, lafu ngyakhkini ya tǝ hura chahal, amawana niifa wal sa tǝ ˈya ɗimi nanǝnya ta farɗa ɗǝ na Chinǝm a wutta ɓa. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Nǝn a ɓarha ɓa a farɗi sakhna Faara. Faara katenggǝn ndǝghǝnni kutǝra kamngga a falghǝnǝm, Kutǝr kutǝrya, Chinǝm yi chingya. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Ndǝghǝnni katenggǝn mbuwa tam mǝrra, nǝn tsaurhahu kukwaryirha mbuwana niifa ndusang fa. ˈWawana niifa tǝ yibrha naghǝn nduwa na mbanggǝn naghǝn wa. Mamnggirha, tǝ sǝsǝmnda yighǝnni pakwanɗǝ. Atsaukake. <verse eid="1TI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Pǝranggǝn nafiya na tǝ kǝna ha ahu ƙǝshidɗiya a tǝrang nda altendan sǝ nduwa shengteena nda kǝna fa, ƙǝsǝr wuɗǝɓǝla mbǝ kwas ngwalaarha wa. Amma a shengteena nda Faara fa na fǝrang ǝngya ƙǝm heu, na mid nǝm ka tǝk mbǝnda nǝm fa. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Pǝranggǝn kanda ǝna nggayirha nda, ǝna tarya nda nggǝngga tǝ ƙǝnayindan, nagha harndan tsahai a fingya mbuwana ˈyasǝ a har ndan. A ndǝghang ngganda ǝngya hai fǝrang na Faara kanda tǝ fiya tǝ hura tal. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />A nanda a ǝnaarha kee ɗǝfang ƙǝna altendan ɗǝ a talara, a tsauka kul tsawud ndan a mbee, tǝna nda wal ka yibrha. <verse eid="1TI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timoti, kulo ˈya ha fǝrona Faara hu haara hai. Ma wumna teena tǝ fiya na a thlǝk laɓar sar Faara wa, tǝ ƙǝm no inggun ma fiya kargha ƙǝkafekkid tsaharhaha yi Faara. Na nda ndaarha na nda a tsaharhaha yi ƙǝkafek, amma mbǝ ƙǝkafek ni wa. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />A hu takkwa tur tsahayini ya fingya nafiya ˈwanda teena kyath nda hai ma fǝrƙǝkafek. Nggayid Faara a tsauka tǝ kun.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>